      en: ["Erts is located at a strategic altitude of 1,340 meters.", "The Church of Sant Romà d'Erts was completed in the year 1774.", "The village is the junction point for the roads leading to Pal and Arinsal.", "The area was formerly home to significant iron forges (Fargues).", "Erts is famous for its high-quality meat restaurants located in old bordas.", "The Valira del Nord river flows directly through the village center."],
